flowchart LR
    subgraph ORIGINAL[VLN-CE original]
      OT[Full trajectory T steps] --> OP[Packed sequence GRU]
      OP --> OM[Two memories 2x512]
      OM --> OE[Test keeps state until done]
      OE --> OR[done mask resets next episode]
    end
    subgraph REAL[VLN-CE real]
      RT[Current launcher: up to 64 steps] --> RL[Python step-by-step GRU]
      RL --> RM[Two memories 2x512]
      RM --> RE[Robot test keeps state]
      RE --> RX[No automatic reset when keep-running-after-stop]
    end
    OP -. equivalent recurrence .-> RL
    TE[Training previous action: expert] -. differs after prediction error .-> TS[Test previous action: model prediction]
    TS --> RE
    TE --> RL
